# Fortune, Loyal Steed: "up to one creature that saddled it this turn" (CR 702.171a, 603.7) - a creature that saddled Fortune on
# an earlier turn is not one. On turn 1 Savannah Lions saddle Fortune. On turn 3 a Thraben Inspector saddles it instead and
# Fortune attacks; at end of combat the Lions are refused and the Inspector is the choice. The Inspector comes back untapped as a
# new object (a second Clue), Fortune scrying 2 again as it enters, and the Lions, never exiled, make no difference.

